WEBVTT

02:32.320 --> 02:35.010
<b>Swift Star Wolf, you go handle 
that one with the limp.</b>

02:35.010 --> 02:36.690
<b>Lure it to the bottom of the hill!</b>

02:44.270 --> 02:46.760
<b>Little Flame Belle, build a wall 
of fire with me at the center.</b>

02:46.760 --> 02:47.720
<b>Cover a wide area with it.</b>

02:47.720 --> 02:50.180
<b>Keep it burning! The bigger 
the fire, the better!</b>

03:07.740 --> 03:08.640
<b>Lightning Strike!</b>

03:14.700 --> 03:15.660
<b>Light it up!</b>

03:26.850 --> 03:29.640
<b>Still haven't had your fill 
yet? Hungry much?</b>

03:37.920 --> 03:41.170
<b>They can't feel pain, 
and they have no fear, huh...</b>

03:41.170 --> 03:42.480
<b>That works out for me.</b>

03:43.430 --> 03:46.810
<b>Little Loach, I'll let you 
have your fill in one go.</b>

03:47.640 --> 03:48.930
<b>Fire Burst!</b>

04:00.940 --> 04:03.220
<b>Burn! Keep burning!</b>

04:10.280 --> 04:12.570
<b>As expected, a sapling needs water.</b>

04:18.160 --> 04:19.840
<b>You've had enough now, yeah?</b>

04:19.840 --> 04:21.540
<b>Refine a few more Soul Essences for me,</b>

04:21.540 --> 04:23.220
<b>and I won't be far from 
fourth-tier Fiery Fist!</b>

04:30.970 --> 04:32.990
<b>You're sturdy, aren't you?</b>

04:32.990 --> 04:35.030
<b>Then I'll add some more fire just for you!</b>

04:35.030 --> 04:36.930
<b>Fiery Fist: Nine Palaces!</b>

04:58.700 --> 05:01.450
<b>Yes! The forty-fourth Star is done!</b>

05:01.450 --> 05:03.130
<b>Farming like this just hits different.</b>

05:03.130 --> 05:05.390
<b>At this rate, I might even 
finish my Stars tonight!</b>

05:10.270 --> 05:11.430
<b>Poison Tumor Corpse General?</b>

05:31.600 --> 05:34.060
<b>Little Flame Belle!
I'll leave the zombies to you!</b>

05:34.060 --> 05:35.470
<b>Just keep on adding fire!</b>

05:50.140 --> 05:51.580
<b>I dare you to ram me.</b>

05:51.580 --> 05:53.470
<b>Time to use you as target practice!</b>

05:55.890 --> 05:57.220
<b>Departing Nether Shield!</b>

06:02.640 --> 06:04.180
<b>You're just toxic!</b>

06:06.250 --> 06:07.860
<b>Black Snake Armor!</b>

06:13.180 --> 06:14.890
<b>I need to get rid of the 
one with poison first.</b>

06:14.890 --> 06:16.660
<b>The poison is the biggest threat to me.</b>

06:20.470 --> 06:21.470
<b>Already?!</b>

06:28.880 --> 06:30.330
<b>Qianjun...</b>

06:48.380 --> 06:51.020
<b>All right, then. I'll risk it all!</b>

06:54.430 --> 06:55.680
<b>Single-Thought Nebula!</b>

06:55.680 --> 06:57.910
<b>It can finish drawing a 
Nebula instantaneously.</b>

06:58.830 --> 07:02.060
<b>Let's try and see how long it 
takes to draw a Star Pattern...</b>

07:04.970 --> 07:08.100
<b>Qianjun-Thunderbolt: Wild Strikes!</b>

07:25.350 --> 07:29.230
<b>Single-Thought Nebula allows me 
to connect seven Stars at once.</b>

07:29.230 --> 07:31.360
<b>That means that basic spells 
are cast instantly,</b>

07:31.360 --> 07:33.720
<b>and intermediate spells 
become significantly faster!</b>

08:00.850 --> 08:01.600
<b>Oh no!</b>

08:05.440 --> 08:06.870
<b>Wait, that's right.</b>

08:06.870 --> 08:10.560
<b>Mrs. Tangyue said that the Black Totem
Snake is the primal source of all poisons.</b>

08:10.560 --> 08:14.640
<b>Using armor made of its skin to fight 
 poisonous mist is a walk in the park...</b>

08:16.280 --> 08:17.850
<b>It's just not your day.</b>

08:18.640 --> 08:20.130
<b>Single-Thought Nebula!</b>

08:20.130 --> 08:21.680
<b>Little Flame Belle, possess!</b>

08:26.000 --> 08:26.850
<b>Meteorite Fist!</b>

08:42.640 --> 08:45.160
<b>Did I overestimate these 
ugly guys' defense</b>

08:45.160 --> 08:47.520
<b>or did I underestimate the 
strength of Meteorite Fist?</b>

08:49.930 --> 08:51.870
<b>Single-Thought Nebula! Lightning Strike!</b>

09:36.900 --> 09:38.560
<b>Water Curtain!</b>

09:56.560 --> 09:59.390
<b>This poison is stronger
than the last one...</b>

10:00.520 --> 10:02.710
<b>I don't know if the Black 
Snake Armor can hold up...</b>

10:03.660 --> 10:05.100
<b>There's still another big one?</b>

10:13.550 --> 10:14.720
<b>Swift Star Wolf!</b>

10:26.850 --> 10:29.180
<b>Thunderbolt: Wild Strikes!</b>

10:33.990 --> 10:36.350
<b>Lightning Strike: Electric Field!</b>

10:47.010 --> 10:47.930
<b>Meteorite Fist!</b>

11:00.890 --> 11:03.100
<b>Looks like that's all you've got!</b>

11:03.100 --> 11:04.520
<b>Let's send you off!</b>

11:05.480 --> 11:07.020
<b>Icebound Coffin!</b>

11:31.140 --> 11:34.280
<b>I'm lucky I already acquired 
the Soul-grade Ice Seed.</b>

11:34.280 --> 11:37.250
<b>Otherwise, I really might not be able 
to take this Corpse Official down.</b>

11:38.680 --> 11:41.810
<b>If I want to get up to 
super-tier like Du Xiao,</b>

11:41.810 --> 11:45.610
<b>then I'll have to awaken a more violent 
element like fire or lightning.</b>

11:48.200 --> 11:50.200
<b>Kill the Corpse Official, but 
give me the Soul Remnant!</b>

11:50.200 --> 11:51.890
<b>Or else you'll never hear the end of it!</b>

11:52.220 --> 11:54.970
<b>No problem. Take it as 
my compensation to you.</b>

11:54.970 --> 11:57.380
<b>I almost forgot I promised that kid.</b>

11:58.420 --> 12:00.220
<b>Otherwise, he's going to 
nag me endlessly again...</b>

12:18.250 --> 12:20.730
<b>You're like a magic machine gun.</b>

12:20.730 --> 12:23.140
<b>You're as strong as an
elite team of intermediate mages!</b>

12:25.930 --> 12:30.890
<b>Use this. Or else your Summoned Beast 
will die soon from the festering wounds.</b>

12:53.210 --> 12:55.100
<b>Hey! Use it sparingly.</b>

12:55.680 --> 12:57.540
<b>Come on, you're so generous, right?</b>

12:57.540 --> 12:59.930
<b>Consider this medicine my compensation.</b>

13:01.020 --> 13:02.430
<b>Can you give me more of this?</b>

13:02.430 --> 13:04.220
<b>This took me a lot of work to make.</b>

13:04.780 --> 13:06.640
<b>Huh? You're a pharmacist?</b>

13:07.350 --> 13:08.890
<b>My secondary element is poison.</b>

13:08.890 --> 13:12.020
<b>Poison? Such a disgusting element exists?</b>

13:12.370 --> 13:13.800
<b>Watch what you're saying!</b>

13:13.800 --> 13:16.480
<b>Looks like you've lived under a rock.</b>

13:16.480 --> 13:19.520
<b>Elements like poison and soul 
are considered Black Magic.</b>

13:19.520 --> 13:21.060
<b>It's more common overseas.</b>

13:23.730 --> 13:25.560
<b>No wonder I haven't really seen it before.</b>

13:25.560 --> 13:28.370
<b>Black Magic tends to violate the 
Magic Association's policies,</b>

13:28.370 --> 13:30.100
<b>so people generally don't 
like to show it off.</b>

13:30.640 --> 13:34.030
<b>Besides, only when you reach higher levels 
do you interact more with Black Magic,</b>

13:34.030 --> 13:36.460
<b>White Magic, Dimensional
Magic, and the like.</b>

13:36.460 --> 13:39.640
<b>Basic and intermediate mages will 
only deal with Elemental Magic.</b>

13:40.640 --> 13:42.970
<b>Here. The Soul Remnant 
from the Corpse Official.</b>

13:42.970 --> 13:45.770
<b>As your reward for helping me 
deal with the little mobs.</b>

13:56.770 --> 13:59.460
<b>I see your Fire Element has reached 
third-tier of the intermediate level.</b>

13:59.460 --> 14:00.720
<b>That's pretty much complete.</b>

14:02.020 --> 14:05.850
<b>I'm four Stars away from 
strengthening all forty-nine Stars.</b>

14:06.430 --> 14:09.360
<b>That's fourth-tier intermediate 
Fire Element Magic!</b>

14:09.360 --> 14:13.350
<b>Your intermediate Fiery Fist is pretty 
close to advanced magic already!</b>

14:23.480 --> 14:25.270
<b>Light Formations are activated already.</b>

14:25.910 --> 14:29.000
<b>From here on, it's up to 
the super-tier big guys.</b>

14:29.000 --> 14:30.700
<b>Let's head back and rejoin everyone.</b>

14:50.350 --> 14:52.560
<b>Can they... handle it?</b>

14:53.120 --> 14:54.620
<b>You and I are both out of magical energy.</b>

14:54.620 --> 14:56.100
<b>We can't help them now.</b>

15:11.660 --> 15:12.680
<b>Commander-rank!</b>

15:19.720 --> 15:22.220
<b>Just how many commander-rank
undead are there?!</b>

15:23.990 --> 15:25.970
<b>Definitely more than
we have advanced mages.</b>

15:37.220 --> 15:40.550
<b>These guys are all advanced 
mages, and yet...</b>

15:40.550 --> 15:43.900
<b>Not all advanced mages can 
take on an enemy on their own,</b>

15:43.900 --> 15:47.220
<b>let alone against a Bone Official that's 
considered a Big Commander...</b>

15:48.810 --> 15:51.170
<b>Are we just too weak?</b>

15:51.170 --> 15:53.970
<b>Can we still... win this?</b>

16:22.720 --> 16:24.970
<b>Wh-What kind of magic is that?!</b>

16:25.760 --> 16:27.740
<b>It's the Light Element Super Spell...</b>

16:27.740 --> 16:29.680
<b>Holy Essence: Demon Judgment Sword!</b>

16:29.680 --> 16:32.990
<b>Du Xiao is about to massacre 
these commander-rank officials.</b>

16:32.990 --> 16:34.850
<b>It's time to end the
Phantom Tyrant Emperor.</b>

16:35.290 --> 16:37.790
<b>Bringing demons to justice 
with a single sword strike.</b>

16:37.790 --> 16:39.100
<b>Now this is what magic should be!</b>

16:40.560 --> 16:44.080
<b>Holy Essence is the strongest 
single-target super spell.</b>

16:44.080 --> 16:47.300
<b>And there are still stronger 
levels above super...</b>

16:47.300 --> 16:49.700
<b>Humans may be born weak and small,</b>

16:49.700 --> 16:52.390
<b>but the potential of humans 
is beyond our imagination.</b>

16:53.320 --> 16:58.080
<b>Now... Do you think we can still win 
this war against these Mutated Beasts?</b>

17:09.280 --> 17:12.280
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:12.280 --> 17:15.280
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:15.280 --> 17:18.280
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:18.280 --> 17:21.280
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

18:37.060 --> 18:40.270
<b><i>Mo Fan, I think you need a breakthrough.</i></b>

18:40.270 --> 18:43.180
<b><i>You seem very concerned about my progress.</i></b>

18:44.390 --> 18:47.310
<b><i>Damn it! We should have 
never left that zone!</i></b>

18:48.800 --> 18:50.730
<b><i>Why is the sun still not rising?!</i></b>

18:51.870 --> 18:54.770
<b><i>For thousands of years, undead
haven't walked in the light of day.</i></b>

18:54.770 --> 18:56.390
<b><i>Just what is going on?!</i></b>

18:59.680 --> 19:01.680
<b><i>I'm going to kill that thing!</i></b>

19:01.680 --> 19:03.520
<b><i>I'm going to slay it!</i></b>

19:04.030 --> 19:06.220
<b><i>Hey! Are you throwing your life away?!</i></b>

19:06.700 --> 19:10.720
<b><i>Whether you believe me or not, I'm 
smelling the scent of the Black Church.</i></b>
